	<body>[b]🧑‍🎄 Christmas game 🎄[/b]

In Santa’s workshop, you must fulfill a wish list by exchanging, passing, or even stealing cards.
Overview
You are one of the helpers at Santa’s workshop and have been assigned to fulfill the wishlist of two children by exchanging, passing, or even stealing cards from other players. Be the first to complete both of your assignments and you win!

Components
The North Pole contains 18 poker sized cards, that include into two types of cards: Assignment cards (4) and Present Cards (14).
Assignment cards show your assigned wishlists, with one on each side. Each wish list has 3 items,
Present cards have two parts: the present associated with a wishlist and a power to use during play.

Game Play:
Draw cards from the draw or discard pile until you have 2 cards in your hand.
Do one of the following:
Play a card and resolve its power.
Discard a card and draw a card from the draw pile.
Pass and take no action.
Check for completion of your assignment. If complete do the following:
Reveal your present cards
If you have the gift card, discard it.
Return any remaining cards to your hand.

